# Only the paths below have an owner, who must approve a pull request that changes them (ruleset owners): the workflows,
# the release, promote and scan gates of deploy/ci/ and the govulncheck gate, the image policy of the cluster, the
# scanners' ignore files, the Makefile with its pinned tools, the Renovate config and this file. Every other file has no
# owner, so the pull requests Renovate merges by itself (renovate.json) never touch an owned path. The last matching line
# wins.
/CODEOWNERS               @anhnvcoder
/.github/                 @anhnvcoder
/renovate.json            @anhnvcoder
/Makefile                 @anhnvcoder
/.trivyignore.yaml        @anhnvcoder
/.grype.yaml              @anhnvcoder
/.govulncheck-ignore.json @anhnvcoder
/deploy/ci/               @anhnvcoder
/tools/vulngate/          @anhnvcoder
/deploy/helm/svp-policy/  @anhnvcoder
